    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is just a big playground for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CatShift is a cute platformer game which is suitable for all ages. You can play as a cat, customize you appearance and use different cat emotions at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a lovely kitty, run, jump and play through different colorful static and randomized levels. Try to get to the top and collect all the fish. Hiss and scratch everything when you are done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoying enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photomode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and kind, no deaths or violence, suitable for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op (is planned for the future phase)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is just a big playground for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CatShift is a cute platformer game which is suitable for all ages. You can play as a cat, customize you appearance and use different cat emotions at any time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a lovely kitty, run, jump and play through different colorful static and randomized levels. Try to get to the top and collect all the fish. Hiss and scratch everything when you are done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoying enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photomode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and kind, no deaths or violence, suitable for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op (is planned for the future phase)</p></li></ul>",
